LangString DescDesktop ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "在桌面创建快捷方式。"
LangString MsgCloseApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "${APP_NAME} 仍在运行，请先关闭，再点击重试。"
LangString RunApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "运行 ${APP_NAME}"

